// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch21 H03 "Kesh" (C 1.0 → P 6.0 → C 1.5), the call. act3_ending.md §2 H03; act3_threads
// T-01 (accepted); vowbound §7. Kesh has been in Asha's roster since Ch16. Asha calls her out of the sleeve one last time;
// she fights at full strength because she wants them strong enough to beat him. Sefir watches.
title: ch21_kesh
location: ch21/heart
---
@letterbox on
@camera HT08
@anim asha raise_staff
@vfx glimmer_bound at=asha_sleeve count=7
@wait 2.0
@anim kesh rise heart_water
@music kesh_first_voice fade=1.0
@wait 3.0
Kesh [determined]: Make them strong, then. All of you. Hit me as hard as you can. #line:ch21_kesh_001
@anim sefir look_at kesh
@wait 2.0
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch21_kesh>>
